{"title":"Vell","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Vell is a named <a href=\"#/monster/basilisk-gazebound\">Gazebound Basilisk</a> seen at level 28.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Vell</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>The Stonegaze Sanctum</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 3×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"5704\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"vell\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"arrow\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f8e0f872cc502e1dabe7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Arrow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">2 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">2 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"basilisk-hide\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/92ba5da9ce736ad2f55e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Basilisk Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-spear\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ce35959c3f749f0efc83.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Spear</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-dagger\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/269b85f477087ff1c8e4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Dagger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Other named Gazebound Basilisks</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/gorrsa\">Gorrsa</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/15cf0f405f80e466dc70.svg\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Vell</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/basilisk-gazebound\">Gazebound Basilisk</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>28</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>359</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>4 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}